      (N p.1).gI (gS D) Λ ∈ Finset.Icc 1 ⌊k2Del D j' δ'⌋₊ ∧ (N p.2).gI (gS D) Λ ∈ Finset.Icc 1 ⌊k2Del D j'' δ''⌋₊ := by
